Package: rsfgseaR
Title: Fgsea-Compatible Rust Preranked Gene Set Enrichment in R
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Denis", "Demin", email = "denisdeminbio@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Author: Denis Demin [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Denis Demin <denisdeminbio@gmail.com>
Description: Provides an R interface to 'rsfgsea', a high-performance Rust
    implementation of preranked Gene Set Enrichment Analysis. Supports classic
    simple and multilevel workflows, redundancy-aware decor execution, and
    native Blitz-compatible execution targeting 'blitzgsea' 1.3.54, with
    results returned in a familiar fgsea-style tabular shape.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc (>= 1.97.1)
URL: https://github.com/deminden/rsfgsea
BugReports: https://github.com/deminden/rsfgsea/issues
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.2)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.3.2)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
